{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"SUSE-SU-2026:23351-1","published":"2026-08-27T13:26:01Z","modified":"2026-09-10T18:23:12.499348841Z","related":["CVE-2026-3886"],"upstream":["CVE-2026-3886"],"summary":"Security update for qemu","details":"This update for qemu fixes the following issue:\n\n- CVE-2026-3886: lack of proper validation of user-supplied data in the `virtio-gpu` driver can lead to local privilege\n  escalation via an integer overflow (bsc#1268061).\n\nOther updates and bugfixes:\n\n- Service: switch back to `tar_scm`.\n- Bug fixes:\n  * target/s390x: Make container ids in `SysIB_15x` 1-based (bsc#1275490).\n  * target/s390x: move `@deprecated-props` to `CpuModelExpansionInfo` (bsc#1273447).\n  * target/s390x: filter deprecated properties based on model expansion type (bsc#1273447).\n  * target/s390x: flag `te` and `cte` as deprecated (bsc#1273447).\n  * target/s390x: report `deprecated-props` in `cpu-model-expansion` reply (bsc#1273447).\n- qemu-ga: fix service file against no-autostart (bsc#1199023).\n","affected":[{"package":{"name":"qemu","ecosystem":"SUSE:Linux Micro 6.1","purl":"pkg:rpm/suse/qemu&distro=SUSE%20Linux%20Micro%206.1"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"8.2.10-slfo.1.1_6.1"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"binaries":[{"qemu":"8.2.10-slfo.1.1_6.1","qemu-SLOF":"8.2.10-slfo.1.1_6.1","qemu-accel-tcg-x86":"8.2.10-slfo.1.1_6.1","qemu-arm":"8.2.10-slfo.1.1_6.1","qemu-audio-spice":"8.2.10-slfo.1.1_6.1","qemu-block-curl":"8.2.10-slfo.1.1_6.1","qemu-block-iscsi":"8.2.10-slfo.1.1_6.1","qemu-block-nfs":"8.2.10-slfo.1.1_6.1","qemu-block-rbd":"8.2.10-slfo.1.1_6.1","qemu-block-ssh":"8.2.10-slfo.1.1_6.1","qemu-chardev-spice":"8.2.10-slfo.1.1_6.1","qemu-guest-agent":"8.2.10-slfo.1.1_6.1","qemu-headless":"8.2.10-slfo.1.1_6.1","qemu-hw-display-qxl":"8.2.10-slfo.1.1_6.1","qemu-hw-display-virtio-gpu":"8.2.10-slfo.1.1_6.1","qemu-hw-display-virtio-gpu-pci":"8.2.10-slfo.1.1_6.1","qemu-hw-display-virtio-vga":"8.2.10-slfo.1.1_6.1","qemu-